      "act": "SETUP",
      "heading": "Two ways to fall short",
      "narration_text": "A model can reason step by step without looking anything up. But if it starts from a wrong fact, every later step carries the mistake. Or it can use tools with no written plan, and lose track of what comes next. ReAct, from a 2022 paper by researchers at Princeton and Google, gives the model both.",
