      "act": "MECHANISM",
      "heading": "Thought, action, observation",
      "narration_text": "The loop has three steps. A thought says what to check. An action calls a tool. The observation is what comes back, and it shapes the next thought. Then the loop repeats. Agent frameworks today, like OpenAI's Agents SDK, run this same loop of tool calls and results.",
